WEBVTT

00:20:28.244 --> 00:20:30.656
to turn off our video feeds
from time to time.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.316
That's what I've been doing.

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:35.126
When people ask what video
conference platform I prefer,

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.376
I often tell them "audio."

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.146
After all, if you know
what I look like, and you trust me,

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.806
you don't need to see
my face every minute.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.086
But for times when
you don't have that option,

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:48.776
Alex recently created a video
conference version of his hold song.

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.917
AC: My version of this
on video conferencing

00:20:50.941 --> 00:20:53.221
is to have a looping version of myself

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:55.657
who's sitting there --

00:20:55.681 --> 00:20:56.832
AG: (Laughs)

00:20:56.856 --> 00:20:58.529
AC: ... seemingly paying attention.

00:20:58.553 --> 00:21:00.794
Technically -- I'm not
saying I would do this --